# The Rust core's binaries. A checkout builds its own (scripts/build-core.sh),
# the release builds the package's (AGENTS.md step 10), and none is committed.
# npm still packs the package's: package.json "files" names bin/, and a
# .gitignore at the root does not take out what "files" names. One inside
# bin/native would.
/bin/native/
